MidPoint 4.11 "Čapek"
----------------------

Release 4.11 is a seventy-second midPoint release code-named Čapek.
The 4.11 release brings accessibility improvements, compliance features as well as many incremental improvements and bugfixes.

Release date: 15th October 2026
Release type: Feature release
End of support: 15th November 2028

Please see the release notes for detailed list of changes:
https://docs.evolveum.com/midpoint/release/4.10/
